he center coordinates from x and y; subtracting −3 gives +3."},{"Ar":"$h=2,\\quad k=-3,\\quad r=4$","En":"$h=2,\\quad k=-3,\\quad r=4$"},{"Ar":"نربع نصف القطر 4 فنحصل على 16 في الطرف الأيمن.","En":"Square radius four to obtain sixteen on the right."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(x-2)^2+(y+3)^2=16$","En":"$(x-2)^2+(y+3)^2=16$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"اطرح إحداثيات المركز داخل القوسين وربّع نصف القطر.","En":"Subtract center coordinates within the brackets and square the radius."},"FormulaLatex":"(x-h)^2+(y-k)^2=r^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(x-2)^2+(y+3)^2=16$","En":"$(x-2)^2+(y+3)^2=16$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(6-2)^2+(-3+3)^2=16$","En":"$(6-2)^2+(-3+3)^2=16$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"(x+2) و(y−3) يعطيان المركز (−2,3).","En":"(x+2) and (y−3) give center (−2,3)."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"(y−3) يعطي إحداثي مركز موجباً 3 بدلاً من −3.","En":"(y−3) gives positive center coordinate three instead of −3."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الطرف الأيمن 4 يعطي نصف قطر 2.","En":"Right side four gives radius two."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$معادلة الدائرة تمثل ثبات المسافة إلى المركز.

